  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-02-24T06:46:03.766Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Me and a friend of mine, and probably some other users have found an issue. Even with toggling the mic on and off, checking permissions, turning threshold all the way down, and uninstalling and reinstalling the app, my mic has not been working. I talk and my characters mouth won't move, my mic logo doesn't light up, no one hears me. It sucks not being able to talk. I check in other games and yup its just vrchat. I'm a quest user by the way. Also for the past few months we quest users have been crashing, which in sure you have heard of in your reviews and other things. It never did that when I first got the game in 2021. I could run vrchat for hours in a full server of 30 people with all avatars turned on. Now I and everyone else crash from simply existing. Are you going to let your game die?",
